guide butler-routes-completionist/wetlands
title Wetlands - Completionist
levels 20-30
zone Wetlands
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step The south road - Dun Modr crater

  note In from Loch Modan through the south tunnels: Dun Modr crater holds the Dark Iron camp. Quests here run 20 to 30, with the Level 60 writs as a special class - the steps say which legs belong to which level.
  accept 303 -- The Dark Iron War - Motley Garmason; Dark Iron Dwarves, the crater
  complete 303 @47.19,15.69 era -- Dark Iron Dwarves for Motley Garmason
  complete 303 @45.65,16.85 era -- Dark Iron Tunnelers for Motley Garmason
  complete 303 @46.44,16.18 era -- Dark Iron Saboteurs for Motley Garmason
  complete 303 @46.5,18.74 era -- Dark Iron Demolitionists for Motley Garmason
  turnin 303 -- The Dark Iron War - back to Motley Garmason
  accept 378 -- The Fury Runs Deep - Motley Garmason; the Head of Deepfury
  note Kam Deepfury has no placed spawn in any zone - the only record points at a Barrens mushroom, which reads corrupt; bring the Head if earned.
  complete 378 @49.67,18.23 era -- the Head of Deepfury for Motley Garmason; Kam Deepfury names no source in the data, so have it in your bags
  turnin 378 -- The Fury Runs Deep - back to Motley Garmason
  accept 631 -- The Thandol Span - Rhag Garmason; Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse, south
  turnin 631 -- The Thandol Span - Rhag's word to Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse
  accept 633 -- The Thandol Span - Rhag Garmason; the Cache of Explosives, Arathi
  note 633's pre (632, an Arathi accept) sits outside this contract - take 633 on its own.
  accept 304 -- A Grim Task - Longbraid the Grim; Balgaras the Foul, the crater
  complete 304 @47,17 era -- Balgaras the Foul for Longbraid the Grim
  turnin 304 -- A Grim Task - back to Longbraid the Grim
  accept 87491 -- Spark of Freedom - Captive Fire Elemental; Roggo Harlbarrow takes it
  turnin 87491 -- Spark of Freedom - the Elemental's word to Roggo Harlbarrow
  accept 274 -- A Dark Threat Looms - Ashlan Stonesmirk; Hinderweir takes it, Loch Modan
  note 274's pre (161, A Dark Threat Looms) lives in the Loch Modan guide - take 274 after that leg.
  accept 88756 -- Bring Back a Bang - Ashlan Stonesmirk; Stolen Explosives, the camps
  complete 88756 @47.19,15.69 era -- Stolen Explosives from the Dun Modr camps for Ashlan Stonesmirk; they name no source in the data, so have them in your bags
  turnin 88756 -- Bring Back a Bang - back to Ashlan Stonesmirk

step The north road - Einar's post

  accept 469 -- Daily Delivery - Einar Stonegrip; James Halloran takes it, Menethil
  note 469 is a one-time delivery despite the name - the data carries no repeatable flag.

step Menethil Harbor - the west row

  note Menethil Harbor is the hub: Halloran, Valstag, Sida, Boran, Tarrel and Flagongut hold the west row, with Helbrek's inn for home.
  accept 484 -- Young Crocolisk Skins - James Halloran; Young Crocolisks, the harbor
  complete 484 @13.35,54.72 era -- Young Crocolisk Skins off the harbor crocolisks for James Halloran
  turnin 484 -- Young Crocolisk Skins - back to James Halloran
  accept 471 -- Apprentice's Duties - James Halloran; Giant Crocolisk Skins, north
  note 471's pre (484 above) fills here - take 471 after it.
  accept 98815 -- Highland Hides - James Halloran; Thicket Raptor Hides
  note The Thicket raptors (260325 and kin) have no placed spawn in any zone - have the hides in your bags.
