  complete 470 @21.31,52.16 era -- Sida's Bag off the Black Ooze for Sida
  turnin 470 -- Digging Through the Ooze - back to Sida
  accept 279 -- Claws from the Deep - Karl Boran; Bluegill Murlocs, west
